ULWItwVEg-4Q7kNvwFO1Trv&_nc_oc=Ado04KTD3QvKzlqp51cC0aCNKqFrOqtUmmQ-fXQxGMtFS-XOB5A5kUH7f6Gp5XeRL7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCFNZtjzkzV9mXDqIqE0Ck1lT2smoej8vDmPfY1G4TTug&oe=6A50FE37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9O7M3hkpnj0Q7kNvwE78igY&_nc_oc=AdqLj16V5kXgqi5l3a2EyileI6AlKvsA4LWjcfMpZg0QpP6ccr20mDzMQme9TK-Iin8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBSgWwxAJt6m7rm1qkcUo6ClQL-khLPXgF5EWKlmkQkig&oe=6A50FFCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6oUSUkPD148Q7kNvwGsUtgD&_nc_oc=Adr4RhxOPSjiL9IKvhh_rvD7Q-nTMz_ubixB4bCcte7fIvBL40iM3vMRiFbjomY-htU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBok0TmiRh8jvUGjkJxhD-fCzsZyF2duJxQkUaLqdmXaQ&oe=6A50ECEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CiTgGjdgjxUQ7kNvwEI7RtL&_nc_oc=AdpyAzRr6gS7sIq9x0rzC_DNXbBiBSJNJiub30-KKjeMg19oUqqEeNouG4ryVWaLiWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDEViWHbXx7Og0033lXhJQ8TUK_b4NueUm9p3VTYqmwFg&oe=6A510E83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vf-_iMp3wXIQ7kNvwF0k0T7&_nc_oc=AdojbzHuiuxEanFWFtM5iYHPAuSvYX3e5AGdLiTUDopBfjI_XtpwLy1PgS3R0ySuQA0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBE1yH9DZ9sEzSgjm7uu9REfGpxWlkRVA_I8bXgmJTn6A&oe=6A5106D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kMX9v-GL_Z0Q7kNvwEULGp_&_nc_oc=Adq5t3b4s07R96iJHZ6m3TOhKR8uxs-bg6jALeSLeS4Dw5M_6Un1ix-xs0DcctTwClU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAwb0tm3HjfW6V6Wq07U8-PJ6DHsDxGdRWizDGbHVEDPQ&oe=6A50E1BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080